o/duration/abs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::chrono::duration)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the absolute value of the duration <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_ltlt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs stream output on a <code>duration</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/from_stream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>from_stream</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  parses a <code>duration</code> from a stream according to the provided format <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_types\">Helper types</h3>\n<p>A type <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* intXX */</span></span> used in the table below means a signed integer type of at least XX bits.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code><b>std::chrono::nanoseconds</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* int64 */</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio\"><span class=\"kw1526\">std::<spa